        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Live API path:&lt;/b&gt; backend/app/services/agent_runner.py imports these same tool functions and calls Gemini once per message, with no ADK overhead. Use &lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;adk web&lt;/font&gt; to explore the full multi-agent tree." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#808080;fontColor=#333333;dashed=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
